/// ADR-0008 (b): materialised Group eliminations. One row per fact_pl row with a counterparty (5,304 rows), account swapped to its block's elimination account (ELIM_GR, ELIM_VSC), amount_local and the pre-translated amounts negated; entity = booking entity. Read only by _Elim Amount (ACME Group view); no slice, cost-centre or counterparty relationships.
